  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>SPECS screen rev: 1680 x 1050
Mouse Sensitivity 3
80.80 DPI


this macro only works if you spawn in the middle of the train cart. If you spawn on the left or right, just restart. Once you load into your base, go to the mission area and choose the Giga Chad Mission on hard. Don’t use the macro yet wait until you see where you spawned. If you’re in the middle, you’re good start it . The macro will plant C4 three times to make sure it works because it can glitch sometimmes ,Whatever you do, don’t move your camera after spawning or it’ll mess everything up. The first time you try it, watch it run to make sure it works with your setup. You have to be on PC and have your loadout in this exact order: G36C, SPAS-12, Heat Knife, Riot Shield, Minigun, First Aid, Sentry, Revive, Sawed-Off, RPG, and Nuke Launcher. bring at least two medics or you’ll die lol . , make sure the macro timing matches your game’s performance, the triple c4 will help with lagg and stuff and the reason you can't move the camera is because it will mess up the macro moving as it is set to spawn camera angle kinda like i said above, off topic but grammerly really sucks lol, note that it may not work everytime if the macro glitches it does it sometimes idk why so keep an eye while it doing its thing</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
